        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-04-52" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Client-encrypted wallet-recovery snapshots are opaque to the server. Separate Earn recovery envelopes use the backend recovery key. Wallet signing secrets remain native.&#xa;PostgreSQL stores wallet ciphertext, caches, replay guards and minimum-return receipts/sequences. Android syncs exact history; iOS supports backup restore, without synced-history recovery/discovery or the complete Earn journey." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
