        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-05-50" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Native checks wallet, role, chain, contracts, amounts, nonce, deadlines, fees and provider payload before signing. Spending payloads are journaled; Android syncs before financial submission. Earn uses a build-fixed gateway, Swap an app-configured gateway, and chain RPC endpoints are pinned.&#xa;Android read access survives app switching until screen/wallet lock, sign-out or restart; it cannot spend. Signing grants and payload deadlines are separate; app departure revokes spending approval. Eligible saved-byte retries retain signatures. Guided group attribution also syncs its candidate checkpoint." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
          <mxGeometry x="58" y="1234" width="1769" height="73" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
