        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-06-45" parent="1" vertex="1" value="The bounded guided deposit grant covers saved per-wallet payouts and deposits, with native minima, gas and retained withdrawal reserves. I₁ and I₂…ₙ are funded separately; every funded wallet invests after its fees.&#xa;Signed bytes are journaled before submission and delivery is verified before vault funding is attributed. Changed or expired authority requires fresh review; this grant never approves a withdrawal." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
