        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-08-41" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Android public-funded buys save 1–5 recipients and amount-aware weights; iOS public input is capped at 10 USDC. Existing-private-balance buys retain three recipients.&#xa;Payouts deliver USDG before permit/order spending. The token contract verifies its permit with LOP as spender; the resolver executes the checked effective recipient encoded by the order/extension. Retries reuse the saved plan." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
