        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-09-41" parent="1" vertex="1" value="New sales require Android’s confidential-sale capability. Sell selects eligible owned holders, excluding Earn; unsellable dust can remain unsigned. Resolver settlement sends public USDG to quoted Aurora deposits.&#xa;Count private Account 2 credit only after bound history matches verified transfers and USDC credit meets the quote minimum scaled to actual USDG input. Android public cashout requires a separate action and approval." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
