        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-10-91" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Account-2 read proofs have empty intents[]; payouts use exact ERC-191 intents. Robinhood UserOps may include a separate 7702 delegation signature. Its 15-minute withdrawal grant can cover redemption and the bound return; refund/expiry needs fresh approval.&#xa;Robinhood portion completion saves credited/minimum evidence without a new spending signature. Ethereum full exit also needs its fresh public-balance check. Historical owner acknowledgement closes lifecycle only; Android cashout is separate; retries reuse signed bytes." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
