        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-11-63" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Account 2 signs empty ERC-191 read proofs and exact payout intents. Holding wallets sign EIP-2612 permits and EIP-712 orders; the token verifies its permit, LOP verifies the order. New private sales and separate public cashout require Android.&#xa;Sale completion needs bound private credit. The signing grant lasts 15 minutes; permit/order deadlines are separate. Android shared reads survive app switching but cannot spend. Native-only recovery has no UI action; eligible saved-byte retries retain signatures." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
          <mxGeometry x="58" y="1664" width="1769" height="73" as="geometry" />
