        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-12-38" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Robinhood selected portions complete after finalized return plus saved credited/minimum evidence; remaining shares can stay invested. Later balance changes do not reopen that checkpoint.&#xa;Ethereum full exit needs ≥1 authenticated return, every submitted return verified, no unresolved operation, zero shares and fresh conservative USDC/ETH/WETH residual &lt;0.50 USDC equivalent. Historical public withdrawals must be paid/cancelled and unblocked.&#xa;Historical Robinhood owner acknowledgement needs finalized transfer, provider SUCCESS and no other pending step; it closes lifecycle only. Refund retry needs a new quote/approval, not another redemption. Cashout separately checks spendable private balance; iOS lacks the full return journey." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
