        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-13-40" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Android restores synced authenticated allocations and signed history after backup recovery, then reconciles read-only. New funding needs metadata-sync acknowledgement; financial submission and guided candidate attribution sync before continuation. iOS has no recovery-sync/discovery capability.&#xa;Read-only evidence can resolve status without spending review. Eligible saved-byte retries add no signature; Android public funding batches still need renewed native scope. New signatures need native authority. Saved return-completion checkpoints are not reopened; owner acknowledgement is lifecycle only. Restore never broadcasts; unknown outcomes stay locked." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
